# AWS Technical Presentations

A collection of my AWS technical presentations, practical demonstrations, and cloud learning resources.

## Presentations

### My Bedrock Script Worked as Admin. Then I Took the Permissions Away.

A practical demonstration of AWS IAM least-privilege principles using Amazon Bedrock and Terraform.

**Topics covered:**
- IAM roles and policies
- Least-privilege access
- Amazon Bedrock permissions
- Terraform infrastructure as code
- Testing access restrictions

**Related project:** [Terraform Bedrock IAM](https://github.com/Bobo-ops01/terraform-bedrock-iam)

